  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a QSVM fraud‑detection pipeline using Quantum‑SMOTE for class imbalance on the Kaggle credit‑card dataset (284,807 transactions, 492 fraud cases). In simulation with Qiskit, a 10‑qubit QSVM with Quantum‑SMOTE achieved 98.8% accuracy, F1=0.962, recall=0.945, and AUC=0.992, outperforming undersampling (92.4% accuracy) and slightly exceeding classical SVM performance (95.1% accuracy at 10 features).",
